TY  - JOUR
TI  - Sure independence screening in generalized linear models with NP-dimensionality
AU  - Jianqing Fan
AU  - Rui Song
T2  - The Annals of Statistics
VL  - 38
IS  - 6
JF  - The Annals of Statistics
JO  - The Annals of Statistics
SP  - 3567
